	"script_source": "Block ProfessorIndoor:\nLock\nTextBox \"Hello [player], we've been expecting you. As you may know, our insitute studies  Jalovea's many varied and complex ecosystems. This is no little task, and we still have so much to discover.\"\nFaceSprite Professor Player\nMoveSprite NPC3 ScientistToProfessor\nWaitMovement NPC3\nFaceSprite NPC3 Professor\nTextBox \"Professor, everything is ready for our new field consultant.\"\nFaceSprite Professor NPC3\nTextBox \"Splendid! Now for the fun part!\"\nFaceSprite Professor Player\nTextBox \"Our Institute has successfully raised three rare species of Fakemon. They're not easy to care for, but we've learned quite a lot from them!\"\nTextBox \"Each comes from a different part of our rainforest. We've prepared one of each for you to meet.\"\nTextBox \"Come along! Let's see which one takes a liking to you!\"\nUnlock\nMoveSprite Professor ProfessorLeave\nHideSprite Professor\nSetFlag PlayerIsPicking\nEnd",
